wine-sg (10.0-925) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 7809 ntdll: NtReadRequestData and NtWriteRequestData. An LPC request's
    data information describes buffers of the sender's; while it waits for
    the reply, the receiver reads and writes them through the port, no more
    than each entry's size. test-lpcdata.

